      "message": "guix: backport oscrypto PBKDF2 timing fix\n\nWith substitutes disabled, guix-codesign can fail when building oscrypto\n1.3.0. The test_dump_private test raises ZeroDivisionError.\n\nThe Guix time-machine bump in bitcoin/bitcoin#36233 pulls in OpenSSL\n3.5.5, which can finish oscrypto's initial PBKDF2 benchmark in under a\nmillisecond. oscrypto truncates this duration to zero and then divides\nby it.\n\nApply the upstream fix:\nwbond/oscrypto@144c12195001b08b9ccecb8a3fd041d22ae24474",
